    "notes": "ONE part with 2 staves; right-hand voice 2 (16th accompaniment, bars 1-2; c'4 r4 in bar 11) stays inside the piano part. 12 bars of 2/4: 32nd run of 8 (bar 3), 64th run of 8 (bar 7), sextuplet 16ths (bar 5), 16th triplets (bars 6 LH, 10 RH), dotted-16th + 32nd pairs and double-dotted eighth + 32nd (bar 6), 8.+32+32 (bar 4), beams across 16th and eighth rests (LH bars 5, 8; RH bar 9), groups that start after a 16th rest (bar 8), tie e'4~e'16 (bar 11), fermatas on the final chords. At 100 dpi (scan-severe.pdf) 32nd and 64th beams merge into solid bands: the number of beams must still be inferred.",
